<template><view class="page"><text class="title">{{project?.name}}</text><text class="desc">{{project?.description||'暂无项目说明'}}</text><view class="tools"><button @tap="addRecord">＋ 新建事项</button><button @tap="choosePhoto">📷 照片记录</button></view><view v-for="r in records" :key="r.id" class="card"><strong>{{r.title}}</strong><text>{{r.content}}</text><button size="mini" @tap="finish(r.id)">完成</button></view></view></template><script setup>import{ref}from'vue';import{onLoad,onShow}from'@dcloudio/uni-app';import{supabase,listRecords,createRecord,finishRecord,uploadProjectPhoto}from'../../lib/supabase';let id;const project=ref(),records=ref([]);onLoad(o=>id=o.id);onShow(load);async function load(){if(!id)return;project.value=(await supabase.from('projects').select('*').eq('id',id).single()).data;records.value=await listRecords(id)}function addRecord(){uni.showModal({title:'新建事项',editable:true,placeholderText:'输入事项内容',success:async r=>{if(r.confirm&&r.content){await createRecord({project_id:id,title:r.content,content:'',scheduled_at:new Date().toISOString()});load()}}})}function choosePhoto(){uni.chooseImage({count:9,success:async r=>{uni.showLoading({title:'上传中'});try{for(const p of r.tempFilePaths){const path=await uploadProjectPhoto(id,p);await createRecord({project_id:id,title:'照片记录',content:'',photo_paths:[path],scheduled_at:new Date().toISOString()})}load()}finally{uni.hideLoading()}}})}async function finish(x){await finishRecord(x);load()}</script><style scoped>.page{padding:22px}.title{display:block;font-size:26px;font-weight:700}.desc{display:block;color:#78909e;margin:8px 0 20px}.tools{display:flex;gap:10px}.tools button{flex:1;background:#e6f5fd;color:#378bb7;border-radius:12px}.card{background:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:15px;margin-top:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.card text{color:#78909e;margin:7px 0}.card button{align-self:flex-start;background:#74c6f3;color:#fff}</style>
